<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA A V INDIA ONE-DAY MATCH ABANDONED - RAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA A V INDIA ONE-DAY MATCH ABANDONED - RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>PIETERMARITZBURG, South Africa 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The day/night match between South Africa A and India was abandoned after heavy rain on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa A 251-6 in 50 overs. India 94-5 in 24.2 overs.</p>
</text>
